/// Datasheet for the `camera` device — a 2D camera mapping world coordinates to screen pixels.
///
/// Requirements only: a `Camera` (defined in camera.arche) is an `eye` (its centre, in world units) and a
/// `zoom` (pixels per world unit). The driver owns the singleton pool; `[1]Camera` is the minimum. The
/// transform funcs take the viewport centre as an argument, so this device has no dependency on `gfx`.
eye(x, y) :: float;
zoom      :: float;

[1]Camera;
